Error: Jet.ReservedDunderName: `__coordinates` is reserved for Jet
  --> Tests/UI/template_paste_core_trait_dunder_member.jet:13:17
    |
 13 |                 #{hook}: fn(self) -> {x: Float, y: Float, frame_id: Int} Never! { {x: 1.0, y: 2.0, frame_id: 0} }
    |                 ^^^^^^^
 Why: Double-underscore names belong to the compiler, generated binders, debugger, serializer, and tools
 Fix: Rename it without the second leading underscore
